---

## 📝 Conclusion
This implementation demonstrates that building robust machine learning systems requires looking beyond raw accuracy metrics. Assessing probability calibration ensures the confidence scores of predictions can be relied upon in critical domains like healthcare, while SHAP and LIME provide necessary transparency to interpret complex model outputs safely.
